Progress Update Rules

1. Update implementation status only after checking with the responsible developer.
2. Add the relevant GitHub PR or commit reference.
3. Request screenshots, test outputs or API responses as evidence.
4. Use Implemented — needs test when implementation exists but testing is incomplete.
5. Use Verified only when supporting evidence is available.
6. Record unresolved questions and blockers.

